  },
  "source": {
    "corpus": "Tekstnet — Det Danske Sprog- og Litteraturselskab",
    "title": "Mit Livs Eventyr (Inklusive Fortsættelse Og Tillæg). 1855-1877",
    "publisher": null,
    "printer": null,
    "place": null,
    "year_published": 1855,
    "url": "https://tekstnet.dk/books/andersen-hc_mit-livs-eventyr-inklusive-fortsaettelse-og-tillaeg-1855-1877/024/"
  },
  "body": [
    {
      "id": 0,
      "stanza_id": 0,
      "text": "Vor Luft er meget mindre lys,",
      "part": false,
      "marginal_notes": []
    },
    {
      "id": 1,
      "stanza_id": 0,
      "text": "Vort Hav har meget mere Gys,",
      "part": false,
      "marginal_notes": []
    },
    {
      "id": 2,
      "stanza_id": 0,
      "text": "Vor Skov har ei den Palmepragt",
      "part": false,
      "marginal_notes": []
    },
    {
      "id": 3,
      "stanza_id": 0,
      "text": "Som Sydens er der sagt.",
      "part": false,
      "marginal_notes": []
    },
    {
      "id": 4,
      "stanza_id": 0,
      "text": "Men Nordlys over Natten flyr",
      "part": false,
      "marginal_notes": []
    },
    {
      "id": 5,
      "stanza_id": 0,
      "text": "Og Skoven hvisker Eventyr",
      "part": false,
      "marginal_notes": []
    },
    {
      "id": 6,
      "stanza_id": 0,
      "text": "I Havets Gang",
      "part": false,
      "marginal_notes": []
    },
    {
      "id": 7,
      "stanza_id": 0,
      "text": "Er Efterklang",
      "part": false,
      "marginal_notes": []
    },
    {
      "id": 8,
      "stanza_id": 0,
      "text": "Af Fædres Seierssang.",
      "part": false,
      "marginal_notes": []
    },
    {
      "id": 9,
      "stanza_id": 1,
      "text": "Fra fine Eventyrets Land",
      "part": false,
      "marginal_notes": []
    },
    {
      "id": 10,
      "stanza_id": 1,
      "text": "Du bærer Bud, Du Vandringsmand",
      "part": false,
      "marginal_notes": []
    },
    {
      "id": 11,
      "stanza_id": 1,
      "text": "Om Vinter Drøm med Nordlys i",
      "part": false,
      "marginal_notes": []
    },
    {
      "id": 12,
      "stanza_id": 1,
      "text": "Og Skovens Spøgeri.",
      "part": false,
      "marginal_notes": []
    },
    {
      "id": 13,
      "stanza_id": 1,
      "text": "Ja, om et Sted saa høit mod Nord",
      "part": false,
      "marginal_notes": []
    },
    {
      "id": 14,
      "stanza_id": 1,
      "text": "At Folk og Dyr tilsammen bor,",
      "part": false,
      "marginal_notes": []
    },
    {
      "id": 15,
      "stanza_id": 1,
      "text": "Og mindste Straa",
      "part": false,
      "marginal_notes": []
    },
    {
      "id": 16,
      "stanza_id": 1,
      "text": "Kan tale saa",
      "part": false,
      "marginal_notes": []
    },
    {
      "id": 17,
      "stanza_id": 1,
      "text": "At Børn det godt forstaae.",
      "part": false,
      "marginal_notes": []
    },
    {
      "id": 18,
      "stanza_id": 2,
      "text": "Hvor Himlen selv i Venlighed",
      "part": false,
      "marginal_notes": []
    },
    {
      "id": 19,
      "stanza_id": 2,
      "text": "Som Juletræ sig bøier ned,",
      "part": false,
      "marginal_notes": []
    },
    {
      "id": 20,
      "stanza_id": 2,
      "text": "Og Alt gaaer sammen som i Gud –",
      "part": false,
      "marginal_notes": []
    },
    {
      "id": 21,
      "stanza_id": 2,
      "text": "Derfra Du bærer Bud!",
      "part": false,
      "marginal_notes": []
    },
    {
      "id": 22,
      "stanza_id": 2,
      "text": "Du kom i Roms Sciroccoluft",
      "part": false,
      "marginal_notes": []
    },
    {
      "id": 23,
      "stanza_id": 2,
      "text": "»Med Bøgeskov og Birkeduft«,",
      "part": false,
      "marginal_notes": []
    },
    {
      "id": 24,
      "stanza_id": 2,
      "text": "Med Melodi",
      "part": false,
      "marginal_notes": []
    },
    {
      "id": 25,
      "stanza_id": 2,
      "text": "Og Trylleri",
      "part": false,
      "marginal_notes": []
    },
    {
      "id": 26,
      "stanza_id": 2,
      "text": "Fra Nordens Fantasi.",
      "part": false,
      "marginal_notes": []
    },
    {
      "id": 27,
      "stanza_id": 3,
      "text": "Du vilde see om vi har gjemt",
      "part": false,
      "marginal_notes": []
    },
    {
      "id": 28,
      "stanza_id": 3,
      "text": "Den Barnelyre, Du har stemt,",
      "part": false,
      "marginal_notes": []
    },
    {
      "id": 29,
      "stanza_id": 3,
      "text": "Og om den toner sødt, selv naar",
      "part": false,
      "marginal_notes": []
    },
    {
      "id": 30,
      "stanza_id": 3,
      "text": "Antiken Takten slaaer!",
      "part": false,
      "marginal_notes": []
    },
    {
      "id": 31,
      "stanza_id": 3,
      "text": "Ja selv i Steen den klinge maa",
      "part": false,
      "marginal_notes": []
    },
    {
      "id": 32,
      "stanza_id": 3,
      "text": "Og skal som Du rundt Verden gaae",
      "part": false,
      "marginal_notes": []
    },
    {
      "id": 33,
      "stanza_id": 3,
      "text": "Med Trylleslag",
      "part": false,
      "marginal_notes": []
    },
    {
      "id": 34,
      "stanza_id": 3,
      "text": "Og hvælve Dag",
      "part": false,
      "marginal_notes": []
    },
    {
      "id": 35,
      "stanza_id": 3,
      "text": "For Kjærlighedens Sag.",
      "part": false,
      "marginal_notes": []
    },
    {
      "id": 36,
      "stanza_id": 4,
      "text": "I",
      "part": false,
      "marginal_notes": []
    },
    {
      "id": 37,
      "stanza_id": 4,
      "text": "»Now give us lands where the olives grow,«",
      "part": false,
      "marginal_notes": []
    },
    {
      "id": 38,
      "stanza_id": 4,
      "text": "Cried the North to the South,",
      "part": false,
      "marginal_notes": []
    },
    {
      "id": 39,
      "stanza_id": 4,
      "text": "»Where the sun with a golden mouth can blow",
      "part": false,
      "marginal_notes": []
    },
    {
      "id": 40,
      "stanza_id": 4,
      "text": "Blue bubbles of grapes down a vineyard-row«!",
      "part": false,
      "marginal_notes": []
    },
    {
      "id": 41,
      "stanza_id": 4,
      "text": "Cried the North to the South.",
      "part": false,
      "marginal_notes": []
    },
    {
      "id": 42,
      "stanza_id": 5,
      "text": "»Now give us men from the sunless plain«,",
      "part": false,
      "marginal_notes": []
    },
    {
      "id": 43,
      "stanza_id": 5,
      "text": "Cried the South to the Nord,",
      "part": false,
      "marginal_notes": []
    },
    {
      "id": 44,
      "stanza_id": 5,
      "text": "»By need of work in the snow and rain,",
      "part": false,
      "marginal_notes": []
    },
    {
      "id": 45,
      "stanza_id": 5,
      "text": "Made strong, and brave by familiar pain!«",
      "part": false,
      "marginal_notes": []
    },
    {
      "id": 46,
      "stanza_id": 5,
      "text": "Cried the South to the North.",
      "part": false,
      "marginal_notes": []
    },
    {
      "id": 47,
      "stanza_id": 6,
      "text": "II",
      "part": false,
      "marginal_notes": []
    },
    {
      "id": 48,
      "stanza_id": 6,
      "text": "»Give lucider hills and intenser seas«,",
      "part": false,
      "marginal_notes": []
    },
    {
      "id": 49,
      "stanza_id": 6,
      "text": "Said the Nord to the South,",
      "part": false,
      "marginal_notes": []
    },
    {
      "id": 50,
      "stanza_id": 6,
      "text": "»Since ever by symbols and bright degrees",
      "part": false,
      "marginal_notes": []
    },
    {
      "id": 51,
      "stanza_id": 6,
      "text": "Art, childlike, climbs to the dear Lord’s knees,«",
      "part": false,
      "marginal_notes": []
    },
    {
      "id": 52,
      "stanza_id": 6,
      "text": "Said the North to the South.",
      "part": false,
      "marginal_notes": []
    },
    {
      "id": 53,
      "stanza_id": 7,
      "text": "»Give strenuos souls for belief and prayer,«",
      "part": false,
      "marginal_notes": []
    },
    {
      "id": 54,
      "stanza_id": 7,
      "text": "Said the South to the North,",
      "part": false,
      "marginal_notes": []
    },
    {
      "id": 55,
      "stanza_id": 7,
      "text": "»That stand in the dark on the lowest stair,",
      "part": false,
      "marginal_notes": []
    },
    {
      "id": 56,
      "stanza_id": 7,
      "text": "While affirming of God, »He is certainlly there«,«",
      "part": false,
      "marginal_notes": []
    },
    {
      "id": 57,
      "stanza_id": 7,
      "text": "Said the South to the North.",
      "part": false,
      "marginal_notes": []
    },
    {
      "id": 58,
      "stanza_id": 8,
      "text": "III",
      "part": false,
      "marginal_notes": []
    },
    {
      "id": 59,
      "stanza_id": 8,
      "text": "»Yet oh, for the skies that are softer and higher!«",
      "part": false,
      "marginal_notes": []
    },
    {
      "id": 60,
      "stanza_id": 8,
      "text": "Sighed the North to the South;",
      "part": false,
      "marginal_notes": []
    },
    {
      "id": 61,
      "stanza_id": 8,
      "text": "»For the flowers that blaze, and the trees that aspire,",
      "part": false,
      "marginal_notes": []
    },
    {
      "id": 62,
      "stanza_id": 8,
      "text": "And the insects made of a song or a fire!«",
      "part": false,
      "marginal_notes": []
    },
    {
      "id": 63,
      "stanza_id": 8,
      "text": "Sighed the North to the South.",
      "part": false,
      "marginal_notes": []
    },
    {
      "id": 64,
      "stanza_id": 9,
      "text": "»And oh, for a seer to discerne the same!«",
      "part": false,
      "marginal_notes": []
    },
    {
      "id": 65,
      "stanza_id": 9,
      "text": "Sighed the South to the North;",
      "part": false,
      "marginal_notes": []
    },
    {
      "id": 66,
      "stanza_id": 9,
      "text": "»For a poet’s tongue of baptismal flame,",
      "part": false,
      "marginal_notes": []
    },
    {
      "id": 67,
      "stanza_id": 9,
      "text": "To call the tree or the flower by its name!«",
      "part": false,
      "marginal_notes": []
    },
    {
      "id": 68,
      "stanza_id": 9,
      "text": "Sighed the South to the North.",
      "part": false,
      "marginal_notes": []
    },
    {
      "id": 69,
      "stanza_id": 10,
      "text": "IV",
      "part": false,
      "marginal_notes": []
    },
    {
      "id": 70,
      "stanza_id": 10,
      "text": "The North sent therefore a man of men",
      "part": false,
      "marginal_notes": []
    },
    {
      "id": 71,
      "stanza_id": 10,
      "text": "As a grace to the South;",
      "part": false,
      "marginal_notes": []
    },
    {
      "id": 72,
      "stanza_id": 10,
      "text": "And thus to Rome came Andersen.",
      "part": false,
      "marginal_notes": []
    },
    {
      "id": 73,
      "stanza_id": 10,
      "text": "»Alas, but must you take him again?«",
      "part": false,
      "marginal_notes": []
    },
    {
      "id": 74,
      "stanza_id": 10,
      "text": "Said the South to the North.",
      "part": false,
      "marginal_notes": []
    },
    {
      "id": 75,
      "stanza_id": 11,
      "text": "Paa Hjemmets Arne Ilden brændte ud,",
      "part": false,
      "marginal_notes": []
    },
    {
      "id": 76,
      "stanza_id": 11,
      "text": "Nu sidder Sorg i Sammenholdets Stue,",
      "part": false,
      "marginal_notes": []
    },
    {
      "id": 77,
      "stanza_id": 11,
      "text": "Din Længsel bar i Jesus Dig til Gud.",
      "part": false,
      "marginal_notes": []
    },
    {
      "id": 78,
      "stanza_id": 11,
      "text": "– En Haandfuld Aske her – hist Livsens Lue.",
      "part": false,
      "marginal_notes": []
    }
  ]
}
